Package: cubical-create
Version: 0.2.2~alpha17
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Cubical Network
Depends: libgtk-4-1, ffmpeg
Description: Native comparison-video creator
 Cubical Compare imports spreadsheets and image sheets, edits every visible
 value, mixes looping soundtracks, and exports animated MP4 videos.
